title: 'TODO CRITICAL: subscription heralds must count historical changes contentward'
pid: f0963f8d-8ac2-42c7-a148-9f649dd99e8b
body: |2-
  If R subscribes to E, and E contains C,
  and C has changed,
  the herald on E as a subscribee of R's
  should count that change among the changes it is reporting.
